    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (2017 Measures No. 6) Act 2017</p>
      <p>No. 118, 2017</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to taxation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—GST treatment of digital currency	3</p>
      <p>A New Tax System (Goods and Services Tax) Act 1999	3</p>
      <p>Schedule 2—Deductible gift recipient	10</p>
